      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i went to the doctor like two years ago for a scratch and they gave me a shot then, so i'm pretty sure i'm still covered for a while. i'm just really busy with work and the clinic is so far away. if i just scrub it really well with some hydrogen peroxide and maybe a bit of antibiotic ointment, wouldn't that be enough to kill whatever was on the metal? i don't want to sit in a waiting room for 3 hours for something that might just be a small cut.",
